<title>USA: Trial date set in Capitol American suit.</title>
<headline>Trial date set in Capitol American suit.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capitol American Financial Corp said on Thursday that a March 3 trial date has been suit in a lawsuit that has held up the company's proposed merger with Conseco Inc.</p>
<p>A Maricopa County, Ariz., judge has limited the trial to four days in Capitol shareholder Loren Hershey's suit, the company said. The merger agreement allows the parties to cancel the deal if it is not completed by March 31.</p>
</text>
